#. children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dear Diary, I was at the park today with Percy.  Danny always told me that "
"she was very sad when her dog died, so I broke Percy's neck because I wanted "
"to see how I'd feel.  I think I was sad for a little, but I kept playing with"
" him but I had to stop after too many pieces fell off and Percy became gross."
"  I buried him in the park so mom and dad wouldn't find out, but Mr. Luca and"
" Mrs Annaliese saw me.  I'm scared they'll tell on me.  Daddy thinks I don't "
"know where he keeps the keys to his gun safe.\""
