msgid ""
"One big footage for some live-action roleplay game, which is mostly "
"unremarkable until some guy with bloodstained clothes arrives running and "
"panting.  \"We need to evacuate.  Hayneth went crazy and someone brought real"
" steel weapons.  It's a bloodbath.  Everyone fights against everyone and it "
"has become one hell of a brawl.  Tim, call the cops right NOW.\" As the "
"camera man utters \"Are… are you serious, dude?\" in disbelief, a bloodied "
"warrior clad in foam armor can be seen in the distance and emits a "
"bloodcurdling war cry.  \"Shit!\", the camera man turns around.  After a "
"couple seconds of very shaky forest floor impressions, the video ends."
msgstr ""

