#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"The photo depicts a serene and well-maintained terrace basked in warm, clear "
"weather.  The central part of the picture is an intriguing sight, where a "
"section of the terrace and a portion of the building behind it appear to have"
" been cleanly removed, as if erased from reality.  To the side, there is a "
"shattered flower pot, spilling out its soil and a plant with long, broad "
"leaves, some of which have also been cut away in a sharp, clean fashion, "
"almost as if sliced with a knife."
msgstr ""

